{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Personal evidence is the default. Projects, stocks and history are separate sources. Exclusions affect retrieval and collection, not original files or existing encrypted archives. A rule names either a path prefix or a directory component found at any depth (optionally only under another directory); the first matching rule wins.",
  "rules": [
